Validate(IntRound((float_test_type)2.5001f) == 3);
//"IEEE Standard 754 defines four rounding modes (see Table 4-8): round to nearest, round
//up, round down, and round toward zero. The default rounding mode for the IA-32 [pentium4] architecture
//is round to nearest. This mode provides the most accurate and statistically unbiased estimate of
//the true result and is suitable for most applications."
//Given an x.5 value, this rounding mode rounds up OR down such that the result will be an EVEN #
//eg 2.5->2, 3.5->4
Validate(IntRound((float_test_type)3.5f) == 4);
Validate(IntRound((float_test_type)2.4999f) == 2);
Validate(IntRound((float_test_type)1.01f) == 1);



